config MTK_GED_GE
	bool "MediaTek GED gralloc-extra (GE) region store (/proc/ged)"
	help
	  Exposes /proc/ged, the MediaTek "gralloc-extra" per-buffer property
	  store spoken by the vendor libgralloc_extra.so / libged.so blobs.

	  This is a pure data store (anonymous-inode region array). It has no
	  dependency on the GPU stack and does not interact with DRM, panthor
	  or panfrost. It is only needed so the proprietary camera HAL can
	  query per-buffer gralloc properties on a mainline kernel.

	  If unsure, say N.
